{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.psychology.digital-media-vs-maturity","title":"Digital Media vs Social Maturity","description":"Bagaimana arsitektur digital dapat memotong proses pendewasaan sosial.","tags":["psychology","digital-culture","maturity"],"custom":{"description":"Bagaimana arsitektur digital dapat memotong proses pendewasaan sosial."},"fname":"notes.psychology.digital-media-vs-maturity","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"0ade7106fc74ff88e942a16e1ef95f84","updated":1782198659037,"created":1782198659037,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.digital-media-vs-maturity","id":"notes.psychology.digital-media-vs-maturity","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.psychology","alias":"psychology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.psychology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.digital-media-vs-maturity","id":"notes.psychology.digital-media-vs-maturity","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.digital-culture","alias":"digital-culture","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.digital-culture"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.digital-media-vs-maturity","id":"notes.psychology.digital-media-vs-maturity","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.maturity","alias":"maturity","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.maturity"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.digital-media-vs-maturity","id":"notes.psychology.digital-media-vs-maturity","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":11,"offset":938},"end":{"line":17,"column":58,"offset":985},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism"}}],"anchors":{"digital-media-vs-social-maturity":{"type":"header","text":"Digital Media vs Social Maturity","value":"digital-media-vs-social-maturity","line":13,"column":0,"depth":1},"the-erosion-of-social-friction":{"type":"header","text":"The Erosion of Social Friction","value":"the-erosion-of-social-friction","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"mechanisms-of-avoidance":{"type":"header","text":"Mechanisms of Avoidance","value":"mechanisms-of-avoidance","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"the-result-false-maturity":{"type":"header","text":"The Result: False Maturity","value":"the-result-false-maturity","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"digital-media-vs-social-maturity\">Digital Media vs Social Maturity<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#digital-media-vs-social-maturity\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"digital-media-vs-social-maturity-1\">Digital Media vs Social Maturity<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#digital-media-vs-social-maturity-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"the-erosion-of-social-friction\">The Erosion of Social Friction<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-erosion-of-social-friction\"></a></h2>\n<p>Pendewasaan sosial terjadi melalui \"gesekan\" (friction) dalam relasi langsung: konflik, permintaan maaf, rasa malu, dan negosiasi. Media digital memungkinkan individu menghindari gesekan ini.</p>\n<h2 id=\"mechanisms-of-avoidance\">Mechanisms of Avoidance<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#mechanisms-of-avoidance\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Avoidance of Accountability</strong>: Salah ngomong bisa di-<em>delete</em>, konflik bisa di-<em>ghosting</em>.</li>\n<li><strong>Pseudo-Validation</strong>: Kebutuhan akan pengakuan dipenuhi oleh <em>like</em> dan <em>update</em> status, bukan melalui kontribusi nyata dalam relasi.</li>\n<li><strong>Echo Chambers</strong>: Algoritma menyediakan pantulan ego yang melindungi individu dari <em>reality check</em>.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"the-result-false-maturity\">The Result: False Maturity<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-result-false-maturity\"></a></h2>\n<p>Digital media bisa membuat seseorang merasa \"bersosialisasi\", padahal ia sedang menghindari aspek terpentar dari sosial yang sebenarnya: negosiasi, feedback, koreksi, dan tanggung jawab.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Validasi digital bisa menggantikan kedewasaan sosial palsu.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism\">Social Maturity and Narcissism Reduction</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">digital-culture (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">maturity (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"tod